      "body": "## 🧠 **简介.**  Rox is a strongly-typed, tree-walk interpreter, implemented in Rust.\n\nBased on the excellent book [Crafting Interpreters](https://craftinginterpreters.com/) by Bob Nystrom, this implementation diverges to Rust patterns, focusing on memory safety, strict type checking, and a robust error-handling architecture.\n\n### 🎯 **地址.** [https://github.com/inblossoms/rox](https://github.com/inblossoms/rox).\n\n### 🪄 **贡献参与.** [https://github.com/inblossoms/rox/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING_zh.md](https://github.com/inblossoms/rox/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING_zh.md).\n\n### 🌟 **Usage.**\n\n**1. REPL Mode (Interactive)**\nRun without arguments to start the interactive shell:\n\n```bash\ncargo run\n```\n\n```javascript\n> var a = \"Hello\";\n> print a + \" World\";\nHello World\n```\n\n**2. Script Mode**\nRun a `.rox` file:\n\n```bash\ncargo run -- scripts/fibonacci.rox\n```\n\n#### 📝 Syntax Examples\n\n**Classes and Inheritance:**\n\n```javascript\nclass Doughnut {\n  cook() {\n    print \"Fry until golden brown.\";\n  }\n}\n\nclass BostonCream < Doughnut {\n  cook() {\n    super.cook();\n    print \"Pipe full of custard.\";\n  }\n}\n\nBostonCream().cook();\n```\n\n**Closures:**\n\n```javascript\nfun makeCounter() {\n  var i = 0;\n  fun count() {\n    i = i + 1;\n    print i;\n  }\n  return count;\n}\n\nvar counter = makeCounter();\ncounter(); // \"1\"\ncounter(); // \"2\"\n```\n\n**Bitwise Operations & Control Flow:**\n\n```javascript\nvar flags = 5; // 0101\nvar mask = 1;  // 0001\n\nif ((flags & mask) == 1) {\n    print \"Bit is set!\";\n}\n\nfor (var i = 0; i < 10; i += 1) {\n    if (i % 2 == 0) continue;\n    print i;\n}\n```\n---\n\n### **更多详细内容请参考：[Rox](https://github.com/inblossoms/rox)** ",
